WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.860
Remember, just hold those lips together a little bit

2
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.000
as you exhale out.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.640
It'll get more oxygen to your system

4
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.440
and you'll actually have more endurance

5
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.800
to get these workouts done.

6
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.600
Just 15 seconds left.

7
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.000
Keep those arms and legs moving.

8
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.520
Nice deep breaths.

9
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.260
Should actually be bringing that heart rate down

10
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.320
just a little bit compared to what you just finished off

11
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.320
with those burpees.

12
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.540
Almost done, five seconds.

13
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.880
And let it relax.

14
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.800
All right, you got 20 seconds to rest.

15
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.960
Just keep those feet moving.

16
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.440
Nice deep breaths.

17
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.160
Try to get that oxygen into your system

18
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.240
as quickly as you can.

19
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.040
We're gonna be starting back up here in just a few seconds.

20
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.680
Our rest is almost up.

21
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.400
We got about five seconds left.

22
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.320
Starting back in with the flutter kick squats

23
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.440
here in just a second.

24
00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.920
And start them up.

25
00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.320
Nice quick kick with those feet

26
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.040
and then deep squat in the middle.

27
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.820
I know those legs are burning like crazy,

28
00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.260
but try to get a really nice deep squat every time.

29
00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.060
Try to get those feet moving every single time.

30
00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.160
Remember, you're only doing this for 50 seconds this time.

31
00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.560
You got 10 seconds to rest.
